{
  "description": "Landing dashboard -- list of all EDGEPROXY dashboards with descriptions, plus a few headline stats. Set this as Grafana's default dashboard via Profile -> Preferences.",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 0,
  "panels": [
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "grafana", "uid": "-- Dashboards --" },
      "description": "All EDGEPROXY dashboards (auto-listed by tag). Click any title to open.",
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "color": { "mode": "thresholds" }, "thresholds": { "steps": [ { "color": "green", "value": null } ] } } },
      "gridPos": { "h": 14, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "displayMode": "list",
        "headings": false,
        "maxItems": 20,
        "query": "",
        "showHeadings": true,
        "showRecentlyViewed": false,
        "showSearch": false,
        "showStarred": false,
        "tags": ["edgeproxy"]
      },
      "title": "Dashboards in this stack",
      "type": "dashlist"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "grafana", "uid": "-- Grafana --" },
      "description": "Dashboard quick-reference -- what each one is for and when to look at it.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 14, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 0 },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "code": { "language": "plaintext", "showLineNumbers": false, "showMiniMap": false },
        "content": "## Dashboard guide\n\n**Overview** -- Single pane summary. KPIs, request rate, host gauges, recent 5xx logs. *First glance.*\n\n**HTTP Traffic** -- Top routers/services, latency heatmap, status code stack, bandwidth. *Traffic shape.*\n\n**Backends** -- Per-service open connections, retries, latency matrix, recent backend errors. *Which backend is misbehaving?*\n\n**TLS & Certificates** -- All certs sorted by expiry, ACME activity log. *Renewal planning.*\n\n**Alerts** -- Currently firing alerts, alert history, rule eval health, silences. *First stop on a page.*\n\n**SLI / SLO** -- Availability, p95 latency, error budget burn (multi-window). *SLO compliance review.*\n\n**Client Analysis** -- Top source IPs, abuse signals, probe-pattern hits. *Defensive triage.*\n\n**Containers** -- Per-container CPU/Mem/Net/IO, restarts, OOM events. *Resource health.*\n\n**Logs Explorer** -- Free-form Loki search across all containers. *Open-ended investigation.*\n\n**Self-Monitoring** -- Prometheus/Loki internals, scrape pool health, cardinality trend. *Monitoring of monitoring.*\n\n---\n\n## Quick links\n\n- [Traefik dashboard](/dashboard/) (proxy itself, not Grafana)\n- [Alertmanager](/alertmanager/) (silence creation)\n- [Prometheus](/prometheus/) (raw query / target inspection)",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "10.4.0",
      "title": "What lives where",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 14 },
      "id": 100,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "Stack Health (live)",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "description": "Traefik process up. 0 = stack is offline.",
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "color": { "mode": "thresholds" }, "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [ { "color": "red", "value": null }, { "color": "green", "value": 1 } ] }, "unit": "short" } },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 0, "y": 15 },
      "id": 3,
      "options": { "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "textMode": "auto" },
      "targets": [ { "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "up{job=\"traefik\"}", "refId": "A" } ],
      "title": "Traefik",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "description": "Currently firing alerts. >0 means action required.",
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "color": { "mode": "thresholds" }, "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [ { "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "red", "value": 1 } ] }, "unit": "short", "links": [ { "title": "Open Alerts dashboard", "url": "/grafana/d/edgeproxy-alerts" } ] } },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 4, "y": 15 },
      "id": 4,
      "options": { "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "textMode": "auto" },
      "targets": [ { "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "sum(ALERTS{alertstate=\"firing\"}) or vector(0)", "refId": "A" } ],
      "title": "Firing Alerts",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "description": "Total request rate to all backends.",
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "color": { "mode": "thresholds" }, "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [ { "color": "green", "value": null } ] }, "unit": "reqps", "links": [ { "title": "Open HTTP Traffic dashboard", "url": "/grafana/d/edgeproxy-http-traffic" } ] } },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 8, "y": 15 },
      "id": 5,
      "options": { "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "area", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "textMode": "auto" },
      "targets": [ { "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "sum(rate(traefik_service_requests_total[1m]))", "refId": "A" } ],
      "title": "Req/s",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "description": "5xx error ratio over 5min. Healthy stack stays green.",
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "color": { "mode": "thresholds" }, "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [ { "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.005 }, { "color": "red", "value": 0.02 } ] }, "unit": "percentunit", "links": [ { "title": "Open Backends dashboard", "url": "/grafana/d/edgeproxy-backends" } ] } },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 12, "y": 15 },
      "id": 6,
      "options": { "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "area", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "textMode": "auto" },
      "targets": [ { "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "sum(rate(traefik_service_requests_total{code=~\"5..\"}[5m])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(traefik_service_requests_total[5m])), 0.001)", "refId": "A" } ],
      "title": "5xx",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "description": "p95 backend response time over 5 min.",
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "color": { "mode": "thresholds" }, "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [ { "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.4 }, { "color": "red", "value": 0.5 } ] }, "unit": "s", "links": [ { "title": "Open SLI/SLO dashboard", "url": "/grafana/d/edgeproxy-slo" } ] } },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 16, "y": 15 },
      "id": 7,
      "options": { "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "area", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "textMode": "auto" },
      "targets": [ { "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(traefik_service_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])) by (le))", "refId": "A" } ],
      "title": "p95 Latency",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "description": "Days until the cert that expires soonest. < 14 = renewal-now territory.",
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "color": { "mode": "thresholds" }, "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [ { "color": "red", "value": null }, { "color": "yellow", "value": 14 }, { "color": "green", "value": 30 } ] }, "unit": "d", "links": [ { "title": "Open TLS dashboard", "url": "/grafana/d/edgeproxy-tls" } ] } },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 20, "y": 15 },
      "id": 8,
      "options": { "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "textMode": "auto" },
      "targets": [ { "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "min(traefik_tls_certs_not_after - time()) / 86400", "refId": "A" } ],
      "title": "Cert Expiry",
      "type": "stat"
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "30s",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "tags": ["edgeproxy", "home", "index"],
  "templating": { "list": [] },
  "time": { "from": "now-30m", "to": "now" },
  "timezone": "",
  "title": "EDGEPROXY -- Home",
  "uid": "edgeproxy-home",
  "version": 1,
  "weekStart": ""
}
